III. Relevant Facts (RPD) [9] The Applicants are citizens of Kosovo. Bujar Huruglica is married to Hanife Huruglica and Hanife’s mother is Sadije Ramadani. Bujar and Sadije have worked in Iraq, Afghanistan and Kosovo. The Applicants are Muslim.

